# Package layering (AiT toolbox — aitssh)

Authoritative detail: [docs/tools/aitssh-internals.md#package-layering](../../docs/tools/aitssh-internals.md#package-layering). Keep this rule in sync when that section changes.

## Call chain

`cmd/aitssh` → `internal/aissh` (package **`aissh`**: `Run`, `Execute`, `NewManager`) → `internal/aissh/<cmd>` (closed loop per subcommand) → `internal/pkg/*` (shared, no product subcommand ownership).

**Directory vs package:** `internal/aissh/` uses Go package `aissh` (`aitssh` is not a valid identifier). Registered subcommand dirs use package names matching Cobra (`shell`, `session`, …). **`internal/aissh/login/`** is the SSH connect route package (not registered as a Cobra subcommand).

## Subcommand package (`internal/aissh/<cmd>/`)

One package per top-level command owns: `Name`, `flags.go`, `parse.go`, `cmd.go` (`New`), `help.go`, `run.go`, **`register.go`** (`init` → `registry.Register`).

- **No** `internal/pkg/aitcmd` or names-only constant packages.
- **No** thin `internal/aissh/<cmd>/` wrappers with parse elsewhere (one closed-loop package per command).

## Registry (OCP)

- Root: `registry.AttachRoot` in `internal/aissh/cli_root.go`; root help via `registry.RootHelpEntries()` / `pkg/helpdoc.WriteRootHelp`（[`registry/root_help.go`](internal/aissh/registry/root_help.go)）。
- **Do not** hand-edit `AddCommand` lists for new top-level or nested commands.
- New top-level: `internal/aissh/<cmd>/` + `_ "…/registry/all/imports.go"`.
- Nested (`aitssh ai`, `aitssh config`, `provider`, `ollama`): parent `<parent>/subregistry` + child `register.go` + `<parent>/registry/all/imports.go`.

## Package name = command name

**Exception:** `internal/aissh/` root is package **`aissh`** (directory `aissh`). Otherwise directory/package = Cobra name (`shell`, `session`, `ai/ask`, `config/set`). **`internal/aissh/login/`** is the connect route (not `registry.Register`). No `*cmd` package suffix. AI REPL: `internal/aissh/ai/mode`. CLI `session`: `internal/aissh/session` (alias pkg session as `pkgsession`).

## `helpdoc`

- Shared: `internal/pkg/helpdoc`. Per-command: `internal/aissh/<cmd>/help.go` (nested: `<parent>/<sub>/help.go`).

## `clihints` (Try SSOT)

- Shared errhint Try example lines: [`internal/pkg/clihints`](internal/pkg/clihints/try_lines.go).
- `internal/aissh` and `internal/pkg/ssh/*` reference `clihints` constants; do not duplicate literals such as `aitssh session --list`.

## `internal/pkg`

- Shared OpenSSH argv: `internal/pkg/ssh/openssh`.
- **Must not** import `internal/aissh`.
- Meta `!ait get`/`put`: protocol names in `internal/pkg/ssh/client/transfer` (`CmdGet`/`CmdPut`); test alignment with `get.Name` / `put.Name` in `internal/aissh`.

## Refactors

Semantic unchanged; **R1–R19**, **A20–A22**; gate: `make fmt && make vet && make test && make build && make test-cross`.
